  "original_pr_description": "Research-only follow-up to #169. Checked the original basemap, Vert 6 crop and two Wild Zone 11 images against their recorded hashes. Affine fit on eight architecture controls (no border/gates in fit); six withheld points, including two separate structures, 1.96 px RMS and 3.09 px worst. Daylight image distinguishes visible green West/bridge/East spans from the red session line in the other frames; upper gate and remaining perimeter are not verified. Research coordinates only; zero production geometry, route, live Site or Supabase changes."
